  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3236,
      "text": "And it is certainly a guidance and mercy for the believers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 77,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 384,
      "ruku": 332,
      "hizbQuarter": 153,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3237,
      "text": "Indeed, your Lord will judge between them by His justice, for He is the All-Mighty, the All-Knowing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 384,
      "ruku": 332,
      "hizbQuarter": 153,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3238,
      "text": "So put your trust in Allah, for you are upon the clear truth.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 384,
      "ruku": 332,
      "hizbQuarter": 153,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3239,
      "text": "You cannot make the dead[25] hear, nor can you make the deaf hear the call when they turn their backs retreating.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 384,
      "ruku": 332,
      "hizbQuarter": 153,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3240,
      "text": "Nor can you guide the blind out of their error, nor can you make anyone hear except those who believe in Our verses, for they are ready to submit to Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 384,
      "ruku": 332,
      "hizbQuarter": 153,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3241,
      "text": "When the decree [of the Hour] comes to pass against them, We will bring forth to them a beast[26] out of the earth that will tell them that the people had no faith in Our verses.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 384,
      "ruku": 332,
      "hizbQuarter": 154,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3242,
      "text": "And [beware of] the Day when We will gather from every nation a group of those who used to reject Our verses, and they will be driven in ranks.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 83,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 384,
      "ruku": 333,
      "hizbQuarter": 154,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3243,
      "text": "When they finally come, He will say, “Did you reject My verses without even comprehending them, or what exactly were you doing?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 84,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 384,
      "ruku": 333,
      "hizbQuarter": 154,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3244,
      "text": "The decree [of punishment] will befall them because of their wrongdoing, leaving them speechless.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 85,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 384,
      "ruku": 333,
      "hizbQuarter": 154,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3245,
      "text": "Do they not see that We made the night for them to rest in, and made the day bright? Indeed, there are signs in this for people who believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 384,
      "ruku": 333,
      "hizbQuarter": 154,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3246,
      "text": "And [beware of] the Day when the Trumpet will be blown, and all those who are in the heavens and on earth will be horrified except whom Allah wills[27], and all will come to Him, fully humbled.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naml",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Ant",
        "numberOfAyahs": 93,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 20,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 384,
      "ruku": 333,
      "hizbQuarter": 154,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3247,
      "text": "You will see the mountains, thinking them firmly fixed[28], but they will be moving like clouds – such is the design of Allah, Who has perfected everything. Indeed, He is All-Aware of what you do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 27,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّمۡلِ",
